{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 130,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'd like to clear up a misconception: there\nis no fourth dimension."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3130,
    "dDurationMs": 3350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As a matter of fact, there is no third dimension,\neither."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6480,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, by that I don't mean that there aren't\nthree dimensions…"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9300,
    "dDurationMs": 4009,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there are, but just we can't tell these dimensions\napart: there's no special direction you can"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13309,
    "dDurationMs": 1201,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "call \"the 1st dimension,\" [north?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14510,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "east?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15510,
    "dDurationMs": 3859,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "up?] so it doesn't make sense to say \"this\nis the 2nd one,\" or \"what's the fourth one?\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19369,
    "dDurationMs": 3361,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's like if you have a jug with three cups\nof water in it... it's easy to tell that there"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 22730,
    "dDurationMs": 3049,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ARE three cups of water, but which is the\nfirst cup?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25779,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the second?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26779,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or the third?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27779,
    "dDurationMs": 1461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Those questions don't even make sense!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29240,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That said, there may be different KINDS of\ndimensions that you CAN tell apart - like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33500,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if you poured three cups of water and one\ncup of oil into our dimensions jug."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36500,
    "dDurationMs": 3410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then you could say \"I have three dimensions\nthat behave in the same way, and one that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39910,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "behaves a different way.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41140,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's what we mean when we say that we\nlive in three spatial dimensions and one time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44440,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "dimension."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45440,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there's nothing crazy about adding another\ncup of water so that you'd have four watery"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48620,
    "dDurationMs": 4590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "cups and one oily cup; likewise we can contemplate\nwhat the universe would be like if there were"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53210,
    "dDurationMs": 4370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "FOUR spatial dimensions and one time dimension…\nor in the case of string theory, nine spatial"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57580,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "dimensions and one time dimension."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59350,
    "dDurationMs": 2950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And while we're at it, it's not even too hard\nto conceive that there might be two dimensions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62300,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of time… but I don't have even have enough\nof one time dimension to explain that now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66060,
    "dDurationMs": 3449,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you'd like to try your brain at visualizing\na world with four spatial dimensions, check"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69509,
    "dDurationMs": 51911,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "out the book Flatland or try solving a 4D\nrubiks cube."
    } ]
  } ]
}
